去闯荡 今天的太阳 只为你滚烫\n\n[Bridge] 就算天空 偶尔会落下大雨一场 那是为了 让你看见彩虹的形状 相信自己 心里藏着巨大的能量 这一刻 就让世界看你发光\n\n[Guitar Solo / 间奏] (吉他扫弦变得急促热烈，鼓点加重)\n\n[Last Chorus] 奔跑吧 向着光的方向 (向着光的方向!) 嘴角上扬 就是最完美的妆 别慌张 路还长 生活本来就该充满希望\n\n大声唱 没什么能阻挡 每一个梦 现在都闪闪发亮 去飞翔 去闯荡 今天的太阳 只为你滚烫\n\n[Outro] 只为你滚烫... Yeah, 向着光... (轻哼) 又是美好的一天。 [End]"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [387.1485595703125, 497.2967224121094], "pos": [-1018.6492919921875, -736.1636352539062], "id": 109, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [267], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["Chinese Pop R&B, Jay Chou style vintage melody, Richie Jen style warm vocal, lighthearted acoustic guitar + traditional Chinese instruments (Dizi/Pipa), 96 BPM, Shijiazhuang street food vibe, sizzling Jianmenzi foley, melodic rap, cozy lunar new year atmosphere, storytelling, catchy hook, bright and bouncy"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [365.98651123046875, 200.08567810058594], "pos": [-534.1521606445312, -737.7698364257812], "id": 112, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#335", "groupcolor": "#88A", "color": "#223"}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 260, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_p